# NAME: OpenAI / ChatGPT / Codex
# UPDATED: 2026-10-10
# TOTAL: 58
# FORMAT: Surge RULE-SET; policy is specified in the profile.
# URL: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JonahLee1999/my_rule/main/openai.list
# REVIEW: See openai-notes.md and ai-audit-20261010.md for sources and scope.
# Manually reviewed. Shared services may also be used by Claude and other apps.
# Main profile: process-scoped OpenAI match first; Claude full list second;
# this list third. Browser shared hosts retain the earlier ClaudeAI policy.

